Summary:
Today’s session involved continuing the development of the Multi-Vendor E-commerce Platform with a focus on strengthening core features. Work was carried out on refining modules such as product management, cart functionality, and order handling. Improvements were made to ensure smoother interaction between different parts of the system. The overall flow of the application was made more consistent and aligned with the planned design.

Outcomes:
Core functionalities were further improved and brought closer to completion. The system became more stable with better coordination between frontend and backend components. This progress helped in shaping a more complete and usable application, preparing it for final testing and refinement stages.
